{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"description":"What an NPC knows, wants and can do, for goal-oriented action planning: facts with their starting values, goals by priority and actions with what they need, what they change and what they cost. The npc system plans the cheapest chain of actions to the first goal it can reach.","properties":{"actions":{"description":"What the NPC can do, in the order ties are broken.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cost":{"default":1.0,"description":"What it costs; plans take the cheapest chain.","exclusiveMinimum":0.0,"type":"number"},"do":{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"What the action does while it runs, at most one of wait, go_to and emit; with none it ends at once. Its effects apply when it ends.","maxProperties":2,"properties":{"emit":{"description":"A world event to emit, about the agent, with the action's name; gameplay code answers it by setting facts.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"go_to":{"description":"The ID of the entity to walk to, along the agent's NavigationAgent3D or 2D path when it has one.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"speed":{"default":0.0,"description":"How fast a go_to walks; 0 is the agent's speed.","minimum":0.0,"type":"number"},"wait":{"default":0.0,"description":"Seconds it takes.","minimum":0.0,"type":"number"}},"type":"object"},"effects":{"additionalProperties":{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},"description":"What it changes when it ends: facts by name, each a value to set (true, false or a whole number) or a change such as \"+1\" or \"-2\".","type":"object"},"name":{"description":"The action's name.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"needs":{"additionalProperties":{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},"description":"What must hold before it runs: Facts by name, each a value it must equal (true, false or a whole number) or a string comparing it: \"!=0\", \"<5\", \"<=5\", \">0\" or \">=1\".","type":"object"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"facts":{"additionalProperties":{"type":["boolean","integer"]},"description":"Every fact by name, with its starting value: true, false (1 and 0) or a whole number.","type":"object"},"format":{"const":1,"description":"The file format's version."},"goals":{"description":"What the NPC wants, tried highest priority first.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"name":{"description":"The goal's name.","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"priority":{"default":0.0,"description":"Higher goals are tried first; equal ones in the file's order.","minimum":-1000000000.0,"type":"number"},"want":{"additionalProperties":{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},"description":"What the goal wants: Facts by name, each a value it must equal (true, false or a whole number) or a string comparing it: \"!=0\", \"<5\", \"<=5\", \">0\" or \">=1\".","type":"object"},"when":{"additionalProperties":{"type":["boolean","integer","string"]},"description":"When the goal applies: Facts by name, each a value it must equal (true, false or a whole number) or a string comparing it: \"!=0\", \"<5\", \"<=5\", \">0\" or \">=1\".","type":"object"}},"required":["name","want"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"search_limit":{"default":2048,"description":"The most states a plan may look at before the goal counts as out of reach.","maximum":1000000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["format","facts","goals","actions"],"title":"SlashEngine NPC brain (.npc.json)","type":"object"}
